{'symbol': 'SYK', 'date': '2019-12-03 22:30:00', 'title': 'STRYKER DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND, PAYABLE ON JANUARY 31, 2020', 'text': 'STRYKER ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.575 PER SHARE PAYABLE ON JANUARY 31, 2020 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON DECEMBER 31, 2019, REPRESENTING AN INCREASE OF APPROXIMATELY 11% VERSUS THE PRIOR YEAR AND UNCHANGED FROM THE PREVIOUS QUARTER.'}